  "ruleText": "He-P 4044.01 Purpose. He-P 4044 establishes requirements for the registration and the use of particle accelerators.\n\nSource. #6827, eff 8-6-98; ss by #8692, INTERIM, eff 7-27-06, EXPIRES: 2-2-07; ss by #8808, eff 1-24-07; ss by #10804, eff 3-26-15; ss by #14302, eff 7-1-25, EXPIRES: 7-1-35",
